 "note": "Ages and researches. An age-up moves the player's units to the next step of their unit lines (new kit, re-priced). Research effects add to stats of units with a tag (the blacksmith kind, a small visual tell only, D-057). Milestone 7 fills in the content and the buildings. Anything with \"status\": \"planned\" (milestone 12) is only drawn on the tech tree page (a blank frame, its name in grey): the sim skips it. Planned research names its effect in words (`effect`). Research may follow another (`after`: it needs that one first, and the page joins them). Effects take one shape (see src/sim/tech.gd): a scope (`tag` with optional `not`, or `building`), a `stat`, and an `add` or a `pct` (the change in percent); or the older {gather, pct}. A creature's or culture's own research (milestone 14) has `own` (\"creature\" or \"culture\"): only the creatures and cultures whose `research` names it get it (src/identity.gd).",
